            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "an excuse, blame, responsibility, a possibility, a basis",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: an excuse, blame, responsibility, a possibility, a basis]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "full, torn, sharp, private, public",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: full, torn, sharp, private, public]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Regarding? (സംബന്ധിച്ച്, sambandhiccŭ.) Although? (എങ്കിലും, eṅkiluṁ.) And yet? (എന്നിട്ടും, enniṭṭuṁ.) However? (എന്നിരുന്നാലും, ennirunnāluṁ.) If so? (എങ്കിൽ, eṅkil.) At least? (കുറഞ്ഞത്, kuṟaññatŭ.) Either? (ഒന്നുകിൽ, onnukil.) A difference? (വ്യത്യാസം, vyatyāsaṁ.) A matter? (കാര്യം, kāryaṁ.) A situation? (സാഹചര്യം, sāhacaryaṁ.) An excuse? (ഒഴികഴിവ്, oḻikaḻivŭ.) Blame? (കുറ്റം, kuṟṟaṁ.) Responsibility? (ഉത്തരവാദിത്തം, uttaravādittaṁ.) A possibility? (സാധ്യത, sādhyata.) A basis? (അടിസ്ഥാനം, aṭisthānaṁ.) Full? (നിറഞ്ഞ, niṟañña.) Torn? (കീറിയ, kīṟiya.) Sharp? (മൂർച്ചയുള്ള, mūrccayuḷḷa.) Private? (സ്വകാര്യ, svakārya.) Public? (പൊതു, potu.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
